return ['domain'=>'zinn-migrate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-migrate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-25T19:15:51+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-25T19:15:51+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Migrate'=>'Zinn® Migrate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate','Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration.'=>'Inapakia tovuti hii ya WordPress — faili na hifadhidata — katika kumbukumbu moja ambayo Zinn Digital® inaweza kuichota, kwa wenyeji ambao hatuwezi kuwafikia kwa njia nyingine yoyote. Isakinishe kwenye tovuti unayoiacha, bonyeza kitufe kimoja, na ubandike kiungo kwenye uhamiaji wako wa Zinn®.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Move this site to Zinn®'=>'Hamisha tovuti hii hadi Zinn®','Move to Zinn®'=>'Hamishia Zinn®','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kufanya hivi.','This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link.'=>'Kifurushi hiki kinajumuisha kila kitu kwenye tovuti hii — faili zake na hifadhidata yake — katika hifadhi moja, na kinakupa kiungo cha faragha kuelekea huko. Bandika kiungo hicho kwenye uhamiaji wako kwenye Zinn® nasi tutahamisha tovuti hiyo. Hakuna kinachotumwa popote hapa hadi utakapochagua kushiriki kiungo hicho.','You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you.'=>'Huenda usihitaji hili. Ikiwa mwenyeji wako wa zamani anakupa FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk au DirectAdmin, Zinn® inaweza kuchukua tovuti hiyo moja kwa moja kwa maelezo hayo na unaweza kuruka programu-jalizi hii kabisa — ni ya haraka na hakuna kinachobaki baadaye. Tumia hii wakati hakuna mojawapo ya hizo inayopatikana kwako.','Room on this server'=>'Nafasi kwenye seva hii','This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down.'=>'Seva hii haitwambii ni kiasi gani cha nafasi ya diski ambacho ni huru, kwa hivyo hatuwezi kukukagua. Kifurushi hiki kinahitaji takriban %s. Ikiwa huna uhakika kuwa kuna nafasi ya kutosha, uliza mwenyeji wako kabla ya kuijenga — seva inayoishiwa na nafasi katikati inasimamisha tovuti.','The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free.'=>'Kifurushi hiki kinahitaji takriban %1$s na seva hii ina nafasi ya bure ya %2$s.','Build the package'=>'Tengeneza kifurushi','Building…'=>'Inajenga…','Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written.'=>'Sasa inapakia: %1$s. Faili %2$s kufikia sasa, %3$s imeandikwa.','your files'=>'failisho zako','your database'=>'hifadhi data yako','Continue'=>'Endelea','Cancel and delete'=>'Ghairisha na ufute','Your package is ready'=>'Kifurushi chako kiko tayari','Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:'=>'Nakili kiungo hiki na ukibandike kwenye uhamiaji wako kwenye Zinn®:','Size: %s.'=>'Ukubwa: %s.','Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished.'=>'Chukulie kiungo hiki kama nenosiri. Mtu yeyote aliye nacho anaweza kupakua tovuti yako nzuri, ikiwa ni pamoja na hifadhidata yako. Tunafuta kifurushi hiki kiotomatiki saa 24 baada ya kuundwa — kifute mwenyewe pindi tu uhamiaji wako utakapokamilika.','Delete the package now'=>'Futa kifurushi hiki sasa','Build it again'=>'Ilijenge tena','This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead.'=>'Seva hii haina kiendelezi cha ZipArchive cha PHP, kwa hivyo hatuwezi kuunda kifurushi hapa. Mwombe mwenyeji wakoakiwezeshe, au tumia fomu ya uhamiaji kwenye Zinn® iliyo na maelezo yako ya FTP au SSH badala yake.','We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable.'=>'Hatukuweza kuunda folda ndani ya saraka yako ya kupakia, kwa hivyo hakuna mahali pa kuandika kifurushi hicho. Angalia kuwa wp-content/uploads inaweza kuandikika.','There is no package being built. Start one first.'=>'Hakuna kifurushi kinachojengwa. Anza kimo kwanza.','We could not open the package file for writing.'=>'Hatukuweza kufungua faili ya kifurushi kwa ajili ya kuandika.','We could not write the database export.'=>'Hatukuweza kuandika usafirishaji wa hifadhidata.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya watumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Hosting ya Zinn® kwa ajili ya WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamiaji wa bure na kidhibiti kilichoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti, vikoa na nafasi za viungo zilizowekwa tayari, huku pesa zikiwekwa kwa usalama hadi pande zote mbili zitakapofurahi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii kwa maisha yao','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, watengenezaji programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwaruhusu watoe zabuni.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakupwa limeshindwa ukaguzi wa uadilifu na halijasakinishwa.']];